  "description": {
    "text": "Battle Road Summer 2004 was held inside Pokémon Festa 2004, with eight regional tournaments from 18 July to 8 August 2004; the Kanto tournaments were held in Tokyo apart from the Festa. Everyone who played got a cosmos holofoil Scramble Energy, Festa visitors got Hironobu Yoshida's Deoxys, the star of that summer's film, and the top three of each division won the Victory Orb. The junior and senior winners went to the 2004 World Championships in Florida as Japan's players.",
